# Notes

## Streak logic
The streak counts consecutive days ending today.  
So if the habit was completed yesterday and today, streak = 2.  
If today is not completed, streak = 0.

If you want a “best streak” too, I can add that.

## SwiftData relationship note
This starter uses a simple `Habit -> [HabitCompletion]` relationship. In a production app, you may want to explicitly define inverse relationships for more control.

