## Critical security requirements for a real banking app
For a production banking app, make sure you implement:

- Backend-driven authentication, never local-only auth
- MFA support
- Short-lived access tokens and refresh tokens
- TLS everywhere
- Certificate pinning
- No sensitive data in logs, screenshots, clipboard, or notifications
- Device binding / risk scoring if appropriate
- Session timeout and re-authentication
- Secure input validation
- Fraud/risk monitoring on backend
- Play Integrity API / device attestation
- Full compliance review, penetration testing, and secure SDLC

