# 18) Important security notes

For a real banking app, you should also implement:

- TLS certificate pinning
- Token refresh flow with short-lived access tokens
- Backend-driven session invalidation
- Device integrity checks
- Root/jailbreak detection strategy
- Play Integrity API
- Secure server-side authentication with MFA
- No sensitive data in logs
- Anti-overlay / anti-tamper protections where appropriate
- PCI DSS / GDPR / local banking compliance review
- Threat modeling and penetration testing

Also:
- Never store raw passwords locally
- Never trust client-side balance logic
- Never expose account authorization logic in the app
- All transfers and sensitive actions must be validated server-side

