# 16. Important banking security recommendations

For a real banking app, also implement:

### Authentication/security
- OAuth2/OpenID Connect with short-lived access tokens
- refresh token rotation
- device binding
- server-side session revocation
- step-up authentication for transfers
- biometric gated token release, not biometric-only navigation
- root/jailbreak/emulator detection as risk signals
- Play Integrity API / DeviceCheck equivalent
- inactivity timeout with re-authentication

### App hardening
- R8/ProGuard obfuscation
- block screenshots on sensitive screens:
  ```kotlin
  window.setFlags(
      WindowManager.LayoutParams.FLAG_SECURE,
      WindowManager.LayoutParams.FLAG_SECURE
  )
  ```
- no sensitive logs
- no tokens in crash reports
- TLS pinning rotation strategy
- secure keyboard/input handling where applicable

### Data protection
- never store raw passwords
- never cache full PAN/account secrets unless absolutely required
- encrypt local data
- clear session on logout
- redact PII in logs and analytics

### API/backend
- transaction signing for high-risk actions
- anti-replay protection
- fraud/risk engine integration
- rate limiting
- anomaly detection
- audit trails

