# 11) Notes on limitations

This implementation is intentionally simple. For a real banking app, you would need:

- Secure authentication with OAuth2/OpenID Connect or bank identity systems
- Biometric login
- Encrypted local storage
- Token management
- HTTPS networking with certificate pinning
- Backend API integration
- Input validation and masking
- Account details and transaction filtering
- Dependency injection with Hilt
- Coroutines + Flow
- Unit/UI tests
- Audit logging
- Accessibility review
- Fraud/risk controls
- Regulatory compliance

