# 15. Optional: queue compaction example

Before syncing, you can reduce duplicate updates:

```javascript
export const compactQueue = (queue) => {
  const latestBySurvey = new Map();

  for (const item of queue) {
    latestBySurvey.set(item.surveyId, item);
  }

  return Array.from(latestBySurvey.values()).sort(
    (a, b) => a.createdAt - b.createdAt
  );
};
```

Then in `syncData()`:

```javascript
const rawQueue = await getSyncQueue();
const queue = compactQueue(rawQueue);
```

