# 7. Important limitations in this initial implementation

This starter works, but has several real-world gaps:

## 1. No conflict resolution
If the same survey is edited on multiple devices, last write wins implicitly.

## 2. Queue handling is simplistic
It removes all queued items after a successful sync call, even if some operations fail individually.

## 3. No edit/update UI
Currently supports create and delete only.

## 4. No authentication
Anyone can sync.

## 5. Backend storage is in-memory
Data disappears when server restarts.

## 6. No service worker / full PWA shell
The app data is offline-capable, but the app bundle itself is not fully cached for installable offline use.

