# 6. Important improvements you should add

This starter works as a foundation, but for a real app you should add:

- Proper user search instead of raw receiver ID input
- Message rooms / conversations table
- Read receipts
- Typing indicators
- Push notifications
- File/image uploads
- Stripe customer portal
- Subscription entitlement checks
- Rate limiting
- Input validation with Zod/Joi
- Password reset
- Email verification
- Secure Socket.IO auth using JWT
- End-to-end encryption if needed
- Moderation / abuse reporting
- Admin dashboard
- Better webhook handling for subscription updates/cancellations
- Redis for scaling Socket.IO across instances

