# 13. Real-time notifications table hook

To create notifications automatically when a message is sent, add a Postgres function and trigger in Supabase:

```sql
create or replace function create_message_notifications()
returns trigger
language plpgsql
as $$
begin
  insert into notifications (user_id, type, data)
  select cm.user_id, 'new_message', jsonb_build_object(
    'conversation_id', new.conversation_id,
    'message_id', new.id,
    'sender_id', new.sender_id,
    'body', new.body
  )
  from conversation_members cm
  where cm.conversation_id = new.conversation_id
    and cm.user_id <> new.sender_id;

  return new;
end;
$$;

create trigger on_message_created
after insert on messages
for each row
execute function create_message_notifications();
```

Then subscribe to notifications in the client if you want a little notification badge.

