You can save this as `index.html` and open it in a browser.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Minimal Realtime Dashboard</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0f172a;
      --panel: #111827;
      --card: #1f2937;
      --text: #e5e7eb;
      --muted: #94a3b8;
      --accent: #22c55e;
      --danger: #ef4444;
      --border: #334155;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
