## 9. Important limitations

A simple domain-based blocker:

- won’t catch all trackers
- may miss first-party tracking endpoints
- may break some site functionality
- needs regular rule updates

For production quality, you’d typically maintain a vetted ruleset similar to privacy filter lists.

