## Notes

This example uses **simulated stock data**. For real stock updates, replace the generator with:

- **WebSocket stream**
- **Server-Sent Events**
- polling a market API

Example replacement point:

```js
function generateNextTickFromFeed(feedData) {
  const ts = feedData.timestamp;
  timestamps.push(ts);

  if (timestamps.length > timeWindow) timestamps.shift();

  feedData.prices.forEach(item => {
    const pctChange = ((item.price - basePrices[item.symbol]) / basePrices[item.symbol]) * 100;
    latestPrices[item.symbol] = item.price;

    heatmapData.push({
      symbol: item.symbol,
      timestamp: ts,
      price: item.price,
      pctChange
    });
  });

  const minTimestamp = timestamps[0];
  heatmapData = heatmapData.filter(d => d.timestamp >= minTimestamp);
  render();
}
```

