## How it works

### Data model
Each cell contains:

```js
{
  symbol,
  time,
  price,
  changePct
}
```

### Real-time updates
Every second:

- oldest timestamp is removed
- a new timestamp is appended
- one new price point per symbol is generated
- the heatmap re-renders

### Zoom/pan
D3 zoom is attached to the SVG:

```js
const zoom = d3.zoom()
  .scaleExtent([1, 8])
  .on("zoom", (event) => {
    currentTransform = event.transform;
    plotArea.attr("transform", currentTransform);
  });
```

This allows mouse wheel zoom and drag pan.

