## Notes / limitations in this initial version

This is a good starting point, but it’s intentionally simple.

### Current limitations
- Uses **simulated data**, not a real WebSocket/API
- Only horizontal zoom/pan
- No virtualized axis labels beyond basic clipping
- No touch support
- No performance batching for very large datasets
- No accessibility layer for keyboard navigation
- Tooltip positioning is basic and may overflow screen edges

