```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Realtime Stock Heatmap</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #111;
      color: #eee;
    }

    .toolbar {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      background: #1b1b1b;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #333;
