# Optional: improved move logic for reordering within and across columns

If you want true reordering support, replace `/api/move-task` with this:

```js
app.post("/api/move-task", (req, res) => {
  const { taskId, sourceColumnId, destinationColumnId, sourceIndex, destinationIndex } = req.body;

  const sourceColumn = board.columns.find((c) => c.id === sourceColumnId);
  const destinationColumn = board.columns.find((c) => c.id === destinationColumnId);

  if (!sourceColumn || !destinationColumn) {
    return res.status(404).json({ error: "Column not found" });
  }

  if (sourceColumnId === destinationColumnId) {
    const [removed] = sourceColumn.taskIds.splice(sourceIndex, 1);
    sourceColumn.taskIds.splice(destinationIndex, 0, removed);
  } else {
    const [removed] = sourceColumn.taskIds.splice(sourceIndex, 1);
    destinationColumn.taskIds.splice(destinationIndex, 0, removed);
  }

  broadcast({ type: "BOARD_UPDATED", payload: board });
  res.json({ success: true, board });
});
```

Then the frontend can calculate exact target positions.

