# Limitations of this initial version

- In-memory storage only, so data resets on restart
- No authentication or user accounts
- No permissions/roles
- Drag-and-drop only appends to end of a column
- No task ordering within a column by exact position
- No conflict resolution for simultaneous edits
- No presence indicators
- No comments, due dates, labels, attachments, or search
- No production hardening or validation

