# 7. Important Limitations in This Initial Version

This is an MVP, so a few things are still basic:

- No database persistence
- No authentication
- No multiple boards/projects
- Drag-and-drop between empty columns may need refinement
- No optimistic UI conflict resolution
- No task editing/deleting yet
- No presence indicators or user cursors

