# 10. What Makes This “Real-Time”

Real-time collaboration here works because:

- Each client connects to the server using Socket.IO
- When one client adds or moves a task, it emits an event
- The server updates the shared board state
- The server broadcasts the latest board to all connected clients

This is a simple but effective MVP sync model.

