# 17. If you want even lower latency

If your goal is closer to HFT, I would recommend a different style:

- single-writer event loops
- CPU affinity
- lock-free SPSC queues
- per-symbol sharding
- no async/await in the hottest path
- custom memory pools
- kernel/network tuning
- DPDK / Solarflare / Onload / RDMA depending on environment

That architecture looks more like:

- one thread for market data normalization
- one thread per strategy shard
- one thread for risk/order gateway
- one thread per venue session

