# Why this scales later

## Today
This runs as a single process with:
- minimal hops
- bounded queues
- clean module interfaces

## Later
You can split components gradually:
- Market data ingest becomes its own process
- Strategy engine can scale horizontally by symbol partition
- Risk engine can remain centralized or partitioned
- Gateway can be one per venue/session
- Order manager can shard by account or symbol

