# 10. What I recommend changing immediately

If you want this to be a solid initial implementation, I would **rewrite the pipeline with explicit stage channels** instead of the shared broadcast bus.

That version would look like this:

```text
MarketData -> Strategy -> Risk -> OMS -> Execution
                         ↘ Rejects -> OMS/Reports
Execution -> State/Positions
```

This is both lower-latency and easier to reason about.

