# 2. High-Level Architecture

Use a **modular event-driven system** with strict separation of concerns:

```text
                   +----------------------+
                   |   Exchange Market    |
                   |      Data Feeds      |
                   +----------+-----------+
                              |
                              v
                    +--------------------+
                    | Market Data Gateway|
                    +--------------------+
                              |
                              v
                      +---------------+
                      | Event Bus     |
                      +---------------+
                       |      |      |
                       v      v      v
                +---------+ +------+ +---------+
                |Strategy | |Risk  | |Recorder |
                |Engine   | |Engine| |/Replay  |
                +----+----+ +--+---+ +---------+
                     |         |
                     +----+----+
                          |
                          v
                   +--------------+
                   | Order Manager|
                   +------+-------+
                          |
                          v
                   +--------------+
                   | Exec Gateway |
                   +------+-------+
                          |
                          v
                   +--------------+
                   |  Exchange    |
                   +--------------+
```

