# Improved metrics design: per-worker histograms

Here’s the pattern to reduce lock contention.

## Replace global histogram with per-worker histograms

```rust
struct WorkerMetrics {
    processed: AtomicU64,
    histogram: Mutex<Histogram<u64>>,
}
```

Then each worker owns one metrics bucket, and the metrics thread aggregates them.

This scales much better.

