## 4. Topic registry

Maps topics to subscribers.

```java
package hfmessaging;

import java.util.List;
import java.util.Map;
import java.util.concurrent.ConcurrentHashMap;
import java.util.concurrent.CopyOnWriteArrayList;

public final class TopicRegistry {
    private final Map<String, CopyOnWriteArrayList<Subscriber>> subscribersByTopic = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();

    public void subscribe(String topic, Subscriber subscriber) {
        subscribersByTopic
                .computeIfAbsent(topic, t -> new CopyOnWriteArrayList<>())
                .add(subscriber);
    }

    public List<Subscriber> getSubscribers(String topic) {
        return subscribersByTopic.getOrDefault(topic, new CopyOnWriteArrayList<>());
    }
}
```

