# 5) Performance tips

For ultra-low latency:
- Pin RX/TX queues to isolated CPU cores
- Disable frequency scaling / use performance governor
- Use RSS and queue affinity carefully
- Prefer hugepages for userspace packet frameworks
- Minimize allocations and syscalls on hot path
- Use per-CPU maps/counters
- Avoid deep parsing unless needed
- Batch where throughput matters; avoid batching where tail latency matters
- Tune NIC offloads appropriately
- Measure with hardware timestamps if possible

