- use **batch RX/TX**
- pin worker threads to CPU cores
- align per-core metrics to cache lines
- avoid shared queues if NIC RSS can steer directly to workers
- use lock-free ring buffers
- minimize parsing to only fields needed by rules
- compile rules into decision trees / prefix tries
- separate fast-path exact matches from slow-path generic rules

