## Features

- Monitors one log file
- Rotates when file exceeds a configured size
- Renames:
  - `app.log` -> `app.log.1`
  - `app.log.1` -> `app.log.2`
  - ...
- Deletes oldest archive beyond retention count
- Recreates the active log file
- Polling-based, so memory usage stays simple and predictable
- No heap allocations after startup

