# Example usage

Rotate `/var/log/app.log` and `/var/log/worker.log` when they exceed 10 MiB, check every 5 seconds, keep 5 rotated copies:

```sh
./memlogd -i 5 -r 5 -s 10485760 /var/log/app.log /var/log/worker.log
```

Daemon mode with pidfile:

```sh
./memlogd -d -p /var/run/memlogd.pid -i 5 -r 3 -s 2097152 /var/log/app.log
```

