## How rotation works

If `/tmp/app.log` exceeds the threshold and `-n 3`:

- remove `/tmp/app.log.3`
- rename `/tmp/app.log.2` → `/tmp/app.log.3`
- rename `/tmp/app.log.1` → `/tmp/app.log.2`
- rename `/tmp/app.log` → `/tmp/app.log.1`
- create fresh `/tmp/app.log`

