This daemon can perform privileged operations. In production, add:

- peer credential checks on the Unix socket
- command authorization
- audit logging
- strict input validation
- capability dropping after startup
- seccomp/AppArmor/SELinux profiles
- separate unprivileged monitor and privileged control components

