```

Ping:

```bash
printf '{"cmd":"ping"}\n' | socat - UNIX-CONNECT:/tmp/osd.sock
```

Get stats:

```bash
printf '{"cmd":"stats"}\n' | socat - UNIX-CONNECT:/tmp/osd.sock | jq
```

List processes:

```bash
printf '{"cmd":"processes"}\n' | socat - UNIX-CONNECT:/tmp/osd.sock | jq
```

Kill a process:

```bash
printf '{"cmd":"kill","pid":1234,"signal":15}\n' | socat - UNIX-CONNECT:/tmp/osd.sock
```

