# Notes on performance

This implementation is reasonably efficient for an initial version because:

- It reuses `sysinfo` collectors instead of recreating them every poll
- It uses async I/O for control-plane communication
- It avoids unnecessary locking by only storing the latest snapshot
- It uses a simple read/write lock around shared state
- It skips missed timer ticks to avoid backlog under load

