## Features

- Captures live packets from an interface
- Parses Ethernet / IPv4 / TCP / UDP headers
- Aggregates flows by 5-tuple:
  - src IP
  - dst IP
  - src port
  - dst port
  - protocol
- Tracks:
  - packet count
  - byte count
  - first seen timestamp
  - last seen timestamp
- Expires inactive flows periodically
- Prints expired flow summaries

