## If you want interrupt-based sampling

For better firmware design, use a timer interrupt:

```c
volatile bool sample_due = false;

void Timer_ISR(void)
{
    sample_due = true;
}

int main(void)
{
    System_Init();

    while (1)
    {
        if (sample_due)
        {
            sample_due = false;
            Process_Sensor();
        }
    }
}
