# What this firmware does

## 1. Periodic sampling
A 1 ms timer interrupt sets a flag every 100 ms.

## 2. Sensor acquisition
The main loop reads the ADC value when the sample flag is set.

## 3. Signal processing
The firmware converts:

- ADC counts → voltage
- voltage → temperature

Then it applies an 8-sample moving average filter to reduce noise.

## 4. Alarm handling
It checks whether the filtered temperature is:

- above 50°C
- below 0°C

## 5. Reporting
It sends formatted sensor data over UART.

