## Example: exponential filter alternative

If you want a lighter filter than a moving average:

```c
static float ExponentialFilter(float input)
{
    static float filtered = 0.0f;
    const float alpha = 0.2f; // 0..1, lower = smoother
    filtered = alpha * input + (1.0f - alpha) * filtered;
    return filtered;
}
```

Use it like this:

```c
sensorVoltage = ADC_ToVoltage(rawSample);
filteredVoltage = ExponentialFilter(sensorVoltage);
```

