## Optional improvement: gravity removal
If you want shock/vibration anomalies rather than orientation changes, use this variant:

```c
float gx = d->fx;   // low-pass estimate ~ gravity/trend
float gy = d->fy;
float gz = d->fz;

float hx = s.x - gx;
float hy = s.y - gy;
float hz = s.z - gz;

float mag = sqrtf(hx*hx + hy*hy + hz*hz);
```

That turns the low-pass output into a gravity estimate and the residual into motion.

