## Design

Pipeline per sample:

1. Read raw accelerometer `(x, y, z)`
2. Remove slow-changing gravity/bias using low-pass estimate
3. Compute motion magnitude
4. Smooth magnitude
5. Maintain rolling baseline mean and variance
6. Flag anomaly if deviation exceeds threshold

This is efficient and suitable for real-time embedded use.

