## Good properties of this implementation
- no heap allocation
- deterministic runtime
- small memory footprint
- easy to tune
- portable ANSI C

## Limitations
- recomputes window statistics every sample: `O(N)`
- threshold is hand-tuned
- uses only magnitude, which may hide directional anomalies
- low-pass only; no high-pass or band-pass separation
- no temperature compensation or runtime recalibration

