Good next steps for a more realistic implementation:

1. Add warm-up handling
2. Add hysteresis / debounce for anomaly flag
3. Use running statistics instead of recomputing the whole window
4. Add per-axis features
5. Add band-pass filtering for vibration use cases
6. Replace static thresholds with adaptive baseline thresholds
7. Add fixed-point version for MCUs without FPU
8. Log timestamps and anomaly duration

