## 4. Improved version with hysteresis for actuators

If you want a slightly better control strategy, here is a helper for hysteresis:

```c
static bool hysteresis_update(bool current_state, float value, float on_threshold, float off_threshold) {
    if (!current_state && value >= on_threshold) {
        return true;
    }
    if (current_state && value <= off_threshold) {
        return false;
    }
    return current_state;
}
```

Example usage:

