```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Real-Time 3D Scene Viewer</title>
  <style>
    html, body {
      margin: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #000;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    #info {
      position: absolute;
      top: 10px;
      left: 10px;
      color: white;
      z-index: 10;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
