# 11. Current Limitations

This initial version has major limitations:

- No broadphase/narrowphase collision system
- Only a ground-plane collision
- No angular velocity or rotation
- No inertia tensor
- No constraints/joints
- No substepping
- Uses explicit Euler integration
- No continuous collision detection
- No networking/replication support
- Directly moves actor transform each frame
- No interaction with Chaos or engine collision queries

