# 13. Optional Improvement: Fixed Timestep

A very useful immediate upgrade is replacing variable timestep integration with fixed substeps.

Example concept inside subsystem:

```cpp
float Accumulator = 0.0f;
const float FixedStep = 1.0f / 60.0f;
```

Then:

```cpp
Accumulator += DeltaTime;
while (Accumulator >= FixedStep)
{
    for (USimplePhysicsComponent* Component : Components)
    {
        if (IsValid(Component))
        {
            Component->Simulate(FixedStep);
        }
    }

    Accumulator -= FixedStep;
}
```

To support this properly, store `Accumulator` as a subsystem member.

