# 10. Better fixed-timestep version of the subsystem

Here is a slightly better subsystem tick with substepping:

## Replace subsystem header private members with:

```cpp
private:
    UPROPERTY()
    TArray<TObjectPtr<UCustomPhysicsBodyComponent>> Bodies;

    float TimeAccumulator = 0.0f;
    float FixedTimeStep = 1.0f / 60.0f;
    int32 MaxSubsteps = 4;
```

## Replace `Tick` with:

```cpp
void UCustomPhysicsWorldSubsystem::Tick(float DeltaTime)
{
    TimeAccumulator += DeltaTime;

    int32 Steps = 0;
    while (TimeAccumulator >= FixedTimeStep && Steps < MaxSubsteps)
    {
        for (int32 Index = Bodies.Num() - 1; Index >= 0; --Index)
        {
            UCustomPhysicsBodyComponent* Body = Bodies[Index];

            if (!IsValid(Body))
            {
                Bodies.RemoveAtSwap(Index);
                continue;
            }

            Body->Integrate(FixedTimeStep);
        }

        TimeAccumulator -= FixedTimeStep;
        ++Steps;
    }
}
```

This is a much better base for future collision/constraint work.

