# 11. Optional improved fixed timestep version

A better subsystem tick pattern is:

## `PhysicsSubsystem.h` addition

```cpp
private:
    float Accumulator = 0.0f;
    float FixedTimeStep = 1.0f / 60.0f;
```

## `PhysicsSubsystem.cpp` improved tick

```cpp
#include "PhysicsSubsystem.h"

void UPhysicsSubsystem::Tick(float DeltaTime)
{
    const float MaxFrameTime = 0.1f;
    DeltaTime = FMath::Min(DeltaTime, MaxFrameTime);

    Accumulator += DeltaTime;

    while (Accumulator >= FixedTimeStep)
    {
        PhysicsWorld.StepSimulation(FixedTimeStep);
        Accumulator -= FixedTimeStep;
    }
}
```

This is much better for simulation consistency.

