## Add accumulator to plugin

```cpp
private:
    float m_accumulator = 0.0f;
    const float m_fixedTimeStep = 1.0f / 60.0f;
```

## Replace `Tick`

```cpp
void CustomPhysicsPlugin::Tick(float deltaTime)
{
    if (!m_initialized || !m_world)
    {
        return;
    }

    m_accumulator += deltaTime;

    while (m_accumulator >= m_fixedTimeStep)
    {
        m_world->StepSimulation(m_fixedTimeStep);
        m_accumulator -= m_fixedTimeStep;
    }
}
```

This gives more stable simulation behavior.

