# Notes on production readiness

For a commercial project, you will likely want:

- fixed timestep world simulation
- body handles instead of direct UObject iteration
- data-oriented storage
- collision abstraction
- thread-safe command queue
- deterministic or near-deterministic stepping
- replication hooks
