# 9. Optional fixed-step upgrade

If you want, here is a simple extension pattern for fixed time step simulation:

Add fields:

```cpp
UPROPERTY(EditAnywhere, BlueprintReadWrite, Category="Custom Physics")
float FixedTimeStep = 1.0f / 60.0f;

UPROPERTY(EditAnywhere, BlueprintReadWrite, Category="Custom Physics")
float MaxSimulationTime = 0.1f;

float TimeAccumulator = 0.0f;
```

Then in `TickComponent`:

```cpp
void UCustomPhysicsComponent::TickComponent(
    float DeltaTime,
    enum ELevelTick TickType,
    FActorComponentTickFunction* ThisTickFunction)
{
    Super::TickComponent(DeltaTime, TickType, ThisTickFunction);

    if (!bSimulate || !GetOwner())
    {
        return;
    }

    DeltaTime = FMath::Min(DeltaTime, MaxSimulationTime);
    TimeAccumulator += DeltaTime;

    while (TimeAccumulator >= FixedTimeStep)
    {
        Simulate(FixedTimeStep);
        TimeAccumulator -= FixedTimeStep;
    }
}
```

This is a strong improvement for consistency.

