# 15. Important production considerations

This implementation is only an initial version. For a large financial institution, you would almost certainly need to add:

## Security
- OAuth2 / OIDC authentication
- Role-based authorization
- mTLS between internal services
- Encryption of account identifiers at rest
- Secrets management via Vault/KMS

## Compliance
- Full audit trail for every state transition
- AML/sanctions screening hooks
- PII masking in logs
- Data retention and legal hold policies

## Reliability
- Outbox pattern for event publishing
- Kafka/RabbitMQ integration
- Retry policies with backoff
- Distributed tracing
- Circuit breakers for downstream banking systems

## Data integrity
- Stronger idempotency semantics
- Request hash comparison for reused idempotency keys
- Double-entry ledger integration
- Reconciliation workflows
- Maker-checker approval flows

## Operational readiness
- Health checks
- Metrics
- Structured logging
- Alerting
- Rate limiting
- Bulkhead isolation

## Business capabilities
- FX support
- Cutoff windows and settlement calendars
- Payment cancellation/reversal flows
- Batch payments
- Scheduled payments
- Multi-tenant/client segregation

