# 11. Example of a more realistic processing flow

```java
@Transactional
public Payment processPayment(UUID paymentId) {
    Payment payment = getPayment(paymentId);

    payment.markProcessing();
    paymentRepository.save(payment);

    FraudDecision fraudDecision = fraudScreeningService.screen(payment);
    if (fraudDecision.isRejected()) {
        payment.markFailed();
        return paymentRepository.save(payment);
    }

    ledgerService.reserveFunds(payment);

    ProcessorResult result = paymentProcessorGateway.submit(payment);
    if (result.isAccepted()) {
        payment.markCompleted();
    } else {
        payment.markFailed();
    }

    payment = paymentRepository.save(payment);
    auditService.log("PROCESS_PAYMENT", payment.getId().toString(), securityContextFacade.currentActor());
    return payment;
}
```

