For enterprise APIs, it’s better not to expose EF entities directly. So let’s use DTOs.

## `Models/CustomerDtos.cs`

```csharp
namespace EnterpriseBackend.Api.Models;

public record CustomerResponse(Guid Id, string Name, string Email, DateTime CreatedUtc);

public record CreateCustomerRequest(string Name, string Email);
```

