# Add authorization policies

A common enterprise improvement is role/scope-based access.

Example in `Program.cs`:

```csharp
builder.Services.AddAuthorization(options =>
{
    options.AddPolicy("CustomerRead", policy =>
        policy.RequireClaim("scp", "customer.read"));

    options.AddPolicy("CustomerWrite", policy =>
        policy.RequireClaim("scp", "customer.write"));
});
```

Then:

```csharp
[HttpGet]
[Authorize(Policy = "CustomerRead")]
public async Task<IActionResult> GetAll(CancellationToken cancellationToken)
```

and

```csharp
[HttpPost]
[Authorize(Policy = "CustomerWrite")]
public async Task<IActionResult> Create([FromBody] CreateCustomerRequest request, CancellationToken cancellationToken)
```

