## Important note

If your handler does any of the following, performance will collapse unless handled carefully:

- blocking database calls
- filesystem I/O
- heavy JSON serialization
- CPU-heavy computation
- mutex contention
- synchronous logging

For those cases:
- use async DB drivers
- offload CPU work to dedicated worker pools
- avoid global locks
- use batching/caching where possible

